id: ops-release-current-diagnosis
title: Report current release blockers instead of remembered approval
description: "Fix #268 in the runner-free continuation: inspect current exact-head runs, failed checks and merge state whenever pending release intent is diagnosed."
type: Issue
status: in_progress
priority: 1
tags[1]: "gh:unbraind/pm-ops#268"
created_at: "2026-11-13T00:10:36.564Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-13T07:07:56.173Z"
author: codex-ops268-1112
comments[7]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-13T00:10:45.798Z",codex-ops268-1112,"Current main has removed the merge-wait loop via durable continuation. Add fresh blocker reporting to the pending decision instead of reintroducing a deadline or sticky flag. Cover approved-then-failed, BEHIND, DIRTY, current waiting/action_required, and settling."
  "2026-11-13T00:20:17.913Z",codex-ops268-1112,"Revert proof: restoring remembered-approval behavior in the diagnosis function makes all four current-state tests fail (approved-then-failed, green BEHIND, DIRTY, and waiting-to-settling/exact-head controls). Removing the pending diagnostic call separately makes the entry-point regression fail. Restored implementation: adapter 76/76 passing. This is the runner-free equivalent of deadline diagnosis; no merge-wait loop remains on main."
  "2026-11-13T00:21:11.118Z",codex-ops268-1112,"Final bounded local gate: timeout 1200 node --test --test-concurrency=2 test/release-discovery-evidence.test.ts test/daily-release-workflow.test.ts test/release-runtime.test.ts test/release-workflow.test.ts test/release-provenance.test.ts test/release-recovery-signer.test.ts test/release-continuation-adapter.test.ts passes 149/149, zero failures/skips. All four direct importers of the changed adapter are included. timeout 1200 npm run lint, timeout 1200 npm run typecheck and timeout 1200 npm run build:test pass. Linked pm tests pass: diagnosis 5/5, receipt 2/2, publishing identity 9/9. Full release:check is delegated to CI per the task gate budget; no full-gate or hosted-release certification is claimed. Changelog regeneration and check follow these final tracker writes."
  "2026-11-13T06:53:22.668Z",codex-ops268-1112,"Round 2: PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M625hqB is valid. Diagnosis currently treats optional failures as blockers and does not share required-run selection. Reuse requiredProtection selection for failing contexts and eligible waiting runs. Factor the duplicated diagnosis fixture setup without changing the zero duplication threshold."
  "2026-11-13T07:01:19.823Z",codex-ops268-1112,"Round 2 revert proof for PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M625hqB: restoring only the earlier releaseWaitReason function makes the optional-failure plus required-wait regression fail. Fixed behavior also ignores optional-only failures and optional waiting runs, while retaining required failure names/links. Shared diagnosis and publication fixtures remove the reported clone pair; no threshold change."
  "2026-11-13T07:04:34.547Z",codex-ops268-1112,"Round 2 final bounded gate: timeout 1200 node --test --test-concurrency=2 test/release-continuation-adapter.test.ts test/release-recovery-signer.test.ts test/daily-release-workflow.test.ts test/release-discovery-evidence.test.ts test/release-repair.test.ts test/release-runtime.test.ts test/release-provenance.test.ts test/release-workflow.test.ts passes 181/181, zero failures/skips. All seven direct module importers plus workflow regression coverage are included. Resolver fixture rerun: 7/7 passing. timeout 1200 npm run duplication reports 0% duplicated lines (0/38667), 144 sources, 0 clone pairs, threshold 0%. timeout 1200 npm run lint, typecheck and build:test pass. Linked pm suites pass diagnosis 5+1 tests and signer 9+4 tests. Full release gate remains delegated to CI. Claims released without closure; final changelog regeneration/check follows these tracker writes."
  "2026-11-13T07:07:54.252Z",codex-ops268-1112,"Additional focused controls cover queued required checks, required legacy status links, absent check links, and a response changing while original publisher metadata is read. Production source is unchanged from the passing 181-test importer/workflow gate. Expanded adapter rerun passes 81/81; resolver rerun passes 7/7. Final duplication rerun: 0% duplicated lines (0/38691), 144 sources, 0 clone pairs, unchanged threshold 0%. Lint, typecheck and build:test reruns pass, each capped at 1200 seconds. Shared helpers replace both duplicated setups. CI certifies the full gate; no live publication is performed."
